[
{
"start": 17.561,
"end": 22.283,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Notion replaces the dozen tools your team is currently using, half the time.",
"char_start": 16,
"char_end": 92,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s02"
},
{
"start": 22.283,
"end": 23.588,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Try notion.com today.",
"char_start": 93,
"char_end": 114,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s03"
},
{
"start": 23.588,
"end": 32.419,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we get into the details \u2013 \u00c9lodie Chevalier was on the previous episode and said that tire pressure is more important than suspension settings.",
"char_start": 115,
"char_end": 264,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 32.419,
"end": 33.191,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 282,
"char_end": 295,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 33.191,
"end": 36.159,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And that ties in with what we're discussing today.",
"char_start": 296,
"char_end": 346,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 36.159,
"end": 42.224,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 \u00c9lodie Chevalier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 363,
"char_end": 459,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 42.224,
"end": 46.698,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Julien Mercier mentioned this same dynamic a few episodes ago.",
"char_start": 460,
"char_end": 554,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 46.698,
"end": 48.173,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 555,
"char_end": 586,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 48.173,
"end": 52.664,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you believe about this topic, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 587,
"char_end": 666,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 52.664,
"end": 60.46,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "It boils down to this: most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 684,
"char_end": 834,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 60.46,
"end": 63.007,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 835,
"char_end": 884,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 63.007,
"end": 67.009,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The framing is important because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 885,
"char_end": 962,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 67.009,
"end": 68.341,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 979,
"char_end": 1008,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 68.341,
"end": 71.832,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1009,
"char_end": 1085,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 71.832,
"end": 73.005,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1103,
"char_end": 1123,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 73.005,
"end": 78.633,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "A bicycle should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1124,
"char_end": 1220,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 78.633,
"end": 82.444,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And the secondary effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 1221,
"char_end": 1286,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 82.444,
"end": 84.087,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I want to explore this further.",
"char_start": 1303,
"char_end": 1334,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s01"
},
{
"start": 84.087,
"end": 87.849,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the structural aspect that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 1335,
"char_end": 1406,
"unit_id": "t0008.u01",
"sent_id": "t0008.s02"
},
{
"start": 87.849,
"end": 88.395,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1424,
"char_end": 1434,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s01"
},
{
"start": 88.395,
"end": 93.694,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 1435,
"char_end": 1532,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s02"
},
{
"start": 93.694,
"end": 96.371,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 1533,
"char_end": 1582,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s03"
},
{
"start": 96.371,
"end": 100.687,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The frame geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 1583,
"char_end": 1662,
"unit_id": "t0009.u01",
"sent_id": "t0009.s04"
},
{
"start": 100.687,
"end": 101.457,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me more.",
"char_start": 1679,
"char_end": 1692,
"unit_id": "t0010.u01",
"sent_id": "t0010.s01"
},
{
"start": 101.457,
"end": 104.894,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Spoke & Wrench is one of the platforms where this is clearly evident.",
"char_start": 1710,
"char_end": 1779,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s01"
},
{
"start": 104.894,
"end": 107.982,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 1780,
"char_end": 1842,
"unit_id": "t0011.u01",
"sent_id": "t0011.s02"
},
{
"start": 107.982,
"end": 110.324,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Tell me how you came to that decision.",
"char_start": 1859,
"char_end": 1897,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s01"
},
{
"start": 110.324,
"end": 112.79,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "How does RockShox fit into this picture?",
"char_start": 1898,
"char_end": 1938,
"unit_id": "t0012.u01",
"sent_id": "t0012.s02"
},
{
"start": 112.79,
"end": 113.382,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 1956,
"char_end": 1966,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s01"
},
{
"start": 113.382,
"end": 117.884,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 1967,
"char_end": 2043,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s02"
},
{
"start": 117.884,
"end": 123.155,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "If you ignore that, you'll end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 2044,
"char_end": 2133,
"unit_id": "t0013.u01",
"sent_id": "t0013.s03"
},
{
"start": 123.155,
"end": 124.077,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "You know what?",
"char_start": 2150,
"char_end": 2164,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s01"
},
{
"start": 124.077,
"end": 128.882,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "I'll be frank: Linear powers all of my engineering work on a daily basis.",
"char_start": 2165,
"char_end": 2238,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s02"
},
{
"start": 128.882,
"end": 134.149,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Linear is the ticketing system designed for speed \u2013 it's built for keyboard use.",
"char_start": 2239,
"char_end": 2319,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s03"
},
{
"start": 134.149,
"end": 136.387,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Use the link in the episode notes.",
"char_start": 2320,
"char_end": 2354,
"unit_id": "t0014.u01",
"sent_id": "t0014.s04"
},
{
"start": 158.556,
"end": 159.866,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "That's a helpful perspective.",
"char_start": 2355,
"char_end": 2384,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s02"
},
{
"start": 159.866,
"end": 163.298,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of human resources and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 2385,
"char_end": 2461,
"unit_id": "t0016.u01",
"sent_id": "t0016.s03"
},
{
"start": 163.298,
"end": 164.319,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "This is how I see it.",
"char_start": 2479,
"char_end": 2500,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s01"
},
{
"start": 164.319,
"end": 171.077,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Most of these mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 2501,
"char_end": 2640,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s02"
},
{
"start": 171.077,
"end": 173.653,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 2641,
"char_end": 2694,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s03"
},
{
"start": 173.653,
"end": 177.008,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've observed this pattern repeating itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 2695,
"char_end": 2764,
"unit_id": "t0017.u01",
"sent_id": "t0017.s04"
},
{
"start": 177.008,
"end": 178.235,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 2781,
"char_end": 2808,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s01"
},
{
"start": 178.235,
"end": 182.053,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised your views on?",
"char_start": 2809,
"char_end": 2893,
"unit_id": "t0018.u01",
"sent_id": "t0018.s02"
},
{
"start": 182.053,
"end": 188.873,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Yes, so \u2013 a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 2911,
"char_end": 3014,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s01"
},
{
"start": 188.873,
"end": 193.575,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Once you've internalized that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3015,
"char_end": 3086,
"unit_id": "t0019.u01",
"sent_id": "t0019.s02"
},
{
"start": 193.575,
"end": 194.632,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3103,
"char_end": 3125,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s01"
},
{
"start": 194.632,
"end": 197.994,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What did you previously believe about this, and what have you revised?",
"char_start": 3126,
"char_end": 3196,
"unit_id": "t0020.u01",
"sent_id": "t0020.s02"
},
{
"start": 197.994,
"end": 199.223,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3214,
"char_end": 3234,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s01"
},
{
"start": 199.223,
"end": 205.186,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The wear and tear on the chain is the best indicator of when you'll need to replace the cassette.",
"char_start": 3235,
"char_end": 3332,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s02"
},
{
"start": 205.186,
"end": 208.443,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Shimano components.",
"char_start": 3333,
"char_end": 3386,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s03"
},
{
"start": 208.443,
"end": 212.5,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Once you understand that, the rest of the decisions become easier.",
"char_start": 3387,
"char_end": 3453,
"unit_id": "t0021.u01",
"sent_id": "t0021.s04"
},
{
"start": 212.5,
"end": 213.364,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "It's settled.\nAlternatively:\nIt's a done deal.\nIt's confirmed.\nIt's arranged.\nIt's agreed.",
"char_start": 3470,
"char_end": 3560,
"unit_id": "t0022.u01",
"sent_id": "t0022.s01"
},
{
"start": 213.364,
"end": 223.008,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Spoke & Wrench within this workflow, the trade-offs become apparent. If you ignore these trade-offs, you end up having to rebuild everything from scratch a year later.",
"char_start": 3578,
"char_end": 3766,
"unit_id": "t0023.u01",
"sent_id": "t0023.s01"
},
{
"start": 223.008,
"end": 224.233,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's start with that.",
"char_start": 3783,
"char_end": 3805,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s01"
},
{
"start": 224.233,
"end": 228.519,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the operational perspective that most auditors do not have access to?",
"char_start": 3806,
"char_end": 3883,
"unit_id": "t0024.u01",
"sent_id": "t0024.s02"
},
{
"start": 228.519,
"end": 229.732,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 3901,
"char_end": 3921,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s01"
},
{
"start": 229.732,
"end": 234.343,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 3922,
"char_end": 3998,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s02"
},
{
"start": 234.343,
"end": 238.105,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 3999,
"char_end": 4061,
"unit_id": "t0025.u01",
"sent_id": "t0025.s03"
},
{
"start": 238.105,
"end": 242.811,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Let's change the subject \u2013 I want to dedicate the final section to risk management.",
"char_start": 4078,
"char_end": 4161,
"unit_id": "t0026.u01",
"sent_id": "t0026.s01"
},
{
"start": 242.811,
"end": 250.862,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "That's where the conversation becomes interesting, because the compromises related to risk management touch upon everything we've discussed.",
"char_start": 4179,
"char_end": 4319,
"unit_id": "t0027.u01",
"sent_id": "t0027.s01"
},
{
"start": 250.862,
"end": 252.554,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Give me a concrete example.",
"char_start": 4336,
"char_end": 4363,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s01"
},
{
"start": 252.554,
"end": 256.626,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 4364,
"char_end": 4429,
"unit_id": "t0028.u01",
"sent_id": "t0028.s02"
},
{
"start": 256.626,
"end": 257.182,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Of course.",
"char_start": 4447,
"char_end": 4457,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s01"
},
{
"start": 257.182,
"end": 264.409,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Most mysterious creaking noises can be resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and tightening the bolts to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 4458,
"char_end": 4588,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s02"
},
{
"start": 264.409,
"end": 267.133,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "We've seen this in teams that use Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 4589,
"char_end": 4638,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s03"
},
{
"start": 267.133,
"end": 270.191,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "I've seen this pattern repeat in three different teams.",
"char_start": 4639,
"char_end": 4694,
"unit_id": "t0029.u01",
"sent_id": "t0029.s04"
},
{
"start": 270.191,
"end": 271.83,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "This is a useful perspective.",
"char_start": 4711,
"char_end": 4740,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s01"
},
{
"start": 271.83,
"end": 276.012,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the contrarian viewpoint that most listeners don't have access to?",
"char_start": 4741,
"char_end": 4815,
"unit_id": "t0030.u01",
"sent_id": "t0030.s02"
},
{
"start": 276.012,
"end": 282.44,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "It all boils down to this: a bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention remains focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 4833,
"char_end": 4953,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s01"
},
{
"start": 282.44,
"end": 286.351,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "The geometry matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 4954,
"char_end": 5027,
"unit_id": "t0031.u01",
"sent_id": "t0031.s02"
},
{
"start": 286.351,
"end": 288.602,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What does the failure mode look like?",
"char_start": 5044,
"char_end": 5081,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s01"
},
{
"start": 288.602,
"end": 292.556,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What is the most underestimated aspect of transmission mechanics?",
"char_start": 5082,
"char_end": 5147,
"unit_id": "t0032.u01",
"sent_id": "t0032.s02"
},
{
"start": 292.556,
"end": 298.137,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
