{
"start": 304.683,
"end": 306.312,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where is it no longer working?",
"char_start": 5410,
"char_end": 5440,
"unit_id": "t0034.u01",
"sent_id": "t0034.s01"
},
{
"start": 306.312,
"end": 314.296,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And when teams adopt Shimano equipment, this compromise becomes apparent \u2013 I've seen this pattern repeat itself in three different teams.",
"char_start": 5458,
"char_end": 5595,
"unit_id": "t0035.u01",
"sent_id": "t0035.s01"
},
{
"start": 314.296,
"end": 316.545,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "What heuristic do you consistently rely on?",
"char_start": 5612,
"char_end": 5655,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s01"
},
{
"start": 316.545,
"end": 320.363,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Where do the fields of interviewing and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 5656,
"char_end": 5729,
"unit_id": "t0036.u01",
"sent_id": "t0036.s02"
},
{
"start": 320.363,
"end": 325.561,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Honestly, the maintenance intervals for the suspension are a risk management decision.",
"char_start": 5747,
"char_end": 5833,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s01"
},
{
"start": 325.561,
"end": 329.671,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone misses.",
"char_start": 5834,
"char_end": 5902,
"unit_id": "t0037.u01",
"sent_id": "t0037.s02"
},
{
"start": 329.671,
"end": 334.402,
"speaker_label": "Camille Dubois",
"text": "Before we conclude, what is one thing that listeners can try this week?",
"char_start": 5919,
"char_end": 5990,
"unit_id": "t0038.u01",
"sent_id": "t0038.s01"
},
{
"start": 334.402,
"end": 338.284,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Choose one of the ideas we discussed and implement it for two weeks.",
"char_start": 6008,
"char_end": 6076,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s01"
},
{
"start": 338.284,
"end": 340.282,
"speaker_label": "Mathieu Lef\u00e8vre",
"text": "Everything else is about iteration.",
"char_start": 6077,
"char_end": 6112,
"unit_id": "t0039.u01",
"sent_id": "t0039.s02"
},
{
"start": 340.282,
"end": 344.072,
